# Figma Plugin Development Rules for AI Assistants

These rules MUST be followed when building Figma plugins. Violations will result in broken UI, poor contrast, and unprofessional appearance.

---

## 🚨 CRITICAL RULES (NEVER BREAK THESE)

### Rule 0: Enable Theme Colors
**MANDATORY:** Always call `showUI` with `{ themeColors: true }` or CSS variables won't work!

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
showUI({ width: 400, height: 500 }, { themeColors: true });

// ❌ WRONG - CSS variables will be undefined!
showUI({ width: 400, height: 500 });
```

### Rule 1: NEVER Use Hardcoded Colors
**ALWAYS** use Figma design tokens. **NEVER** use hex, rgb, hsl, or named colors.

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
color: 'var(--figma-color-text)'
backgroundColor: 'var(--figma-color-bg-secondary)'
borderColor: 'var(--figma-color-border)'

// ❌ WRONG - will break in dark mode!
color: '#333'
backgroundColor: '#f5f5f5'
borderColor: '#ddd'
```

### Rule 2: Always Specify Line Height
**EVERY** text element MUST have an explicit `lineHeight`.

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
style={{ fontSize: '11px', lineHeight: '16px' }}

// ❌ WRONG - will look cramped/broken
style={{ fontSize: '11px' }}
```

### Rule 3: Use Framework Spacing System
Use `Container`, `Stack`, `VerticalSpace` from `@create-figma-plugin/ui`. **NEVER** use arbitrary padding/margin values.

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
<Container space="medium">
  <Stack space="small">
    {/* content */}
  </Stack>
</Container>

// ❌ WRONG - arbitrary values
<div style={{ padding: '12px', marginBottom: '8px' }}>
```

### Rule 4: Proper Bottom Padding
**ALWAYS** add bottom padding to scrollable content.

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
<div className="custom-scroll-content" style={{ paddingBottom: '16px' }}>

// ❌ WRONG - content will touch bottom
<div className="custom-scroll-content">
```

---

## 📐 DESIGN TOKEN REFERENCE

### Text Colors (use these ONLY)
- `var(--figma-color-text)` - Primary text
- `var(--figma-color-text-secondary)` - Labels, descriptions
- `var(--figma-color-text-tertiary)` - Subtle information
- `var(--figma-color-text-disabled)` - Disabled states
- `var(--figma-color-text-brand)` - Accent/emphasis
- `var(--figma-color-text-onbrand)` - Text on brand backgrounds
- `var(--figma-color-text-oncomponent)` - Text on colored backgrounds

### Background Colors (use these ONLY)
- `var(--figma-color-bg)` - Main background
- `var(--figma-color-bg-secondary)` - Cards, containers
- `var(--figma-color-bg-tertiary)` - Nested containers
- `var(--figma-color-bg-hover)` - Hover states
- `var(--figma-color-bg-brand)` - Primary actions
- `var(--figma-color-bg-brand-secondary)` - Secondary brand
- `var(--figma-color-bg-brand-tertiary)` - Subtle brand
- `var(--figma-color-bg-success)` - Success states
- `var(--figma-color-bg-warning)` - Warning states
- `var(--figma-color-bg-danger)` - Error states

### Border Colors (use these ONLY)
- `var(--figma-color-border)` - Standard borders
- `var(--figma-color-border-strong)` - Emphasized borders
- `var(--figma-color-border-brand)` - Accent borders
- `var(--figma-color-border-disabled)` - Disabled borders

---

## 📏 TYPOGRAPHY STANDARDS

### Font Sizes (stick to these ONLY)
- `16px` - Large headers (rare)
- `13px` - Section headers (lineHeight: '16px', fontWeight: '600')
- `11px` - Body text DEFAULT (lineHeight: '16px', fontWeight: '400')
- `10px` - Small text (lineHeight: '16px')

### Font Weights (use these ONLY)
- `400` - Regular (default)
- `500` - Medium (subtle emphasis)
- `600` - Semibold (headers)

### Line Heights (use these ONLY)
- `16px` - Standard (DEFAULT)
- `24px` - Large headers only

**NEVER:**
- Use custom `font-family`
- Use font sizes outside this scale
- Omit `lineHeight`

---

## 🎨 SPACING SYSTEM

Use framework spacing values ONLY:
- `extraSmall` - 4px
- `small` - 8px
- `medium` - 16px
- `large` - 24px
- `extraLarge` - 32px

```typescript
<Container space="medium">      // 16px padding
  <Stack space="small">          // 8px between items
    <VerticalSpace space="large" />  // 24px explicit spacing
  </Stack>
</Container>
```

---

## 🏗️ LAYOUT PATTERNS

### Full-Height Plugin Layout
```typescript
<div style={{ 
  display: 'flex', 
  flexDirection: 'column', 
  height: '100vh',
  overflow: 'hidden',
  backgroundColor: 'var(--figma-color-bg)'  // REQUIRED
}}>
  <div className="custom-scroll-container" style={{ flex: 1, position: 'relative' }}>
    <div className="custom-scroll-content" style={{ paddingBottom: '16px' }}>
      <Container space="medium">
        {/* content */}
      </Container>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

### Border Radius (use these ONLY)
- `6px` - Standard (cards, containers)
- `4px` - Small elements (badges, tags)

---

## 🔘 COMPONENT PATTERNS

### Use Framework Components
**ALWAYS** use components from `@create-figma-plugin/ui`:
- `Button` - for all buttons
- `Textbox` - for all text inputs
- `Dropdown` - for all dropdowns
- `Text`, `Muted` - for text
- `Container`, `Stack`, `Inline`, `VerticalSpace` - for layout

### Button Pattern
```typescript
import { Button } from '@create-figma-plugin/ui';

<Button onClick={handleAction}>Primary</Button>
<Button onClick={handleAction} secondary>Secondary</Button>
<Button onClick={handleAction} fullWidth>Full Width</Button>
<Button onClick={handleAction} disabled>Disabled</Button>
```

### Input Pattern with Label
```typescript
<Stack space="small">
  <Text style={{ fontSize: '11px', fontWeight: '500' }}>
    Label
  </Text>
  <Textbox
    value={value}
    placeholder="Enter text..."
    onValueInput={setValue}
  />
</Stack>
```

---

## ⚠️ COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID

### ❌ Missing themeColors
```typescript
showUI({ width: 400, height: 500 }); // WRONG!
```

### ❌ Hardcoded Colors
```typescript
style={{ color: '#333', backgroundColor: '#f5f5f5' }} // WRONG!
```

### ❌ Missing Line Height
```typescript
style={{ fontSize: '11px' }} // WRONG!
```

### ❌ Arbitrary Spacing
```typescript
style={{ padding: '12px', marginBottom: '8px' }} // WRONG!
```

### ❌ No Bottom Padding
```typescript
<div className="custom-scroll-content">  // WRONG!
```

### ❌ Wrong Font Sizes
```typescript
style={{ fontSize: '14px' }} // WRONG! Use 11px or 13px
```

### ❌ Custom Fonts
```typescript
style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial' }} // WRONG! Never set font-family
```

---

## ✅ PRE-FLIGHT CHECKLIST

Before considering code complete, verify:

**Backend:**
- [ ] `showUI` called with `{ themeColors: true }`
- [ ] Proper event handlers with `on()` and `emit()`

**Colors:**
- [ ] All colors use `var(--figma-color-*)` tokens
- [ ] Zero hardcoded hex/rgb/hsl colors
- [ ] Hover states use `--figma-color-bg-hover`

**Typography:**
- [ ] Font sizes: 10px, 11px, 13px, or 16px ONLY
- [ ] ALL text has explicit `lineHeight` (16px or 24px)
- [ ] Font weights: 400, 500, or 600 ONLY
- [ ] NO custom font families

**Spacing:**
- [ ] Uses `Container`, `Stack`, `VerticalSpace`
- [ ] NO arbitrary padding/margin values
- [ ] Bottom padding on scrollable content (16px minimum)
- [ ] Spacing uses extraSmall/small/medium/large/extraLarge

**Layout:**
- [ ] Main container is `height: 100vh`
- [ ] Scrollable content uses `custom-scroll-container` pattern
- [ ] Background color explicitly set
- [ ] Border radius is 6px or 4px ONLY

---

## 📚 REQUIRED IMPORTS

### UI Components
```typescript
import { 
  render, 
  Button, 
  Textbox, 
  Dropdown,
  Text, 
  Muted,
  Container, 
  Stack, 
  Inline, 
  VerticalSpace 
} from '@create-figma-plugin/ui';
import { h } from 'preact';
import { useState, useEffect, useRef } from 'preact/hooks';
```

### Backend Utilities
```typescript
import { showUI, on, emit } from '@create-figma-plugin/utilities';
```

### Styles
```typescript
import '!./output.css';
```

---

## 🎓 PERFECT EXAMPLE

```typescript
import { render, Button, Textbox, Text, Stack, Container } from '@create-figma-plugin/ui';
import { h } from 'preact';
import { useState } from 'preact/hooks';
import { on, emit } from '@create-figma-plugin/utilities';
import '!./output.css';

function Plugin() {
  const [value, setValue] = useState('');
  
  return (
    <div style={{ 
      display: 'flex', 
      flexDirection: 'column', 
      height: '100vh',
      overflow: 'hidden',
      backgroundColor: 'var(--figma-color-bg)'
    }}>
      <div className="custom-scroll-content" style={{ paddingBottom: '16px' }}>
        <Container space="medium">
          <Stack space="medium">
            
            <Text style={{ 
              fontSize: '13px', 
              fontWeight: '600',
              lineHeight: '16px'
            }}>
              Section Title
            </Text>
            
            <Stack space="small">
              <Text style={{ 
                fontSize: '11px', 
                fontWeight: '500',
                lineHeight: '16px'
              }}>
                Label
              </Text>
              <Textbox
                value={value}
                placeholder="Enter text..."
                onValueInput={setValue}
              />
            </Stack>
            
            <Button onClick={() => {}} fullWidth>
              Submit
            </Button>
            
          </Stack>
        </Container>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

export default render(Plugin);
```

**Backend:**
```typescript
import { showUI, on, emit } from '@create-figma-plugin/utilities';

export default function () {
  showUI({ width: 400, height: 500 }, { themeColors: true });
  
  on('submit', (data) => {
    figma.notify('Success!');
  });
}
```

---

## 🔍 TESTING REQUIREMENTS

**Visual Testing:**
1. Test in Figma light mode - verify readability
2. Test in Figma dark mode - verify colors adapt correctly
3. Scroll to bottom - verify proper padding
4. Check all interactive states (hover, disabled)

**Code Review:**
1. Search for hex colors (#) - should be ZERO matches
2. Search for rgb/hsl - should be ZERO matches
3. Verify `themeColors: true` in showUI call
4. Verify all text has lineHeight
5. Verify spacing uses framework components

